      "amount": "1 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "black pepper",
      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together coconut milk, lime juice, olive oil, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the chicken, green pepper, lemongrass, garlic, and ginger to the bowl and mix well.",
    "Thread the chicken and green pepper onto skewers.",
    "Grill the skewers for 10-12 minutes, turning occasionally.",
    "Serve hot and garnish with additional lemongrass and lime wedges if desired.",
    "Let the skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve with a side of cauliflower rice or a salad for a low-carb meal."
  ],
